  "description": "The Recorder's browser surface: `RecorderPage`, and `RecorderProvider` running the `useRecorder` state machine behind it. Takes the sniffer's response events over `RecorderBridge`, accumulates them with `recorder-core-js`'s `Recording`, and carries the encoded archive to the host on the same bridge. Reads and changes the Recorder's bookmarks through host commands. No fs — the host writes the file.",
